Defect: SMI-INVALID-DATE https://pysnmp.github.io/pysmi/stable/mib-defects.html#smi-invalid-date

LAST-UPDATED gives a date and the Z, 20000628Z, with no time. The repair
keeps the day and writes it in the full form, at 00:00.

No publisher on record serves this module, so the baseline is the text
this repository carried before the repair; which publication that was is
not recovered.

--- a/NMS-SMI
+++ b/NMS-SMI
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
 		FROM SNMPv2-SMI;
 
 nms MODULE-IDENTITY
-	LAST-UPDATED "20000628Z"
+	LAST-UPDATED "200006280000Z"
 	ORGANIZATION ""
 	CONTACT-INFO
 		""
